load @term/seed/code/structure/manifold
  find manifold

# A manifold, the concept: a space that looks locally like flat space but may be globally curved, the stage curved
# geometry and general relativity are written on. The hyperbolic four-space the substrate tiles is a manifold of
# constant negative curvature. The canonical manifold form is in the structure folder; this concept file marks it as a
# pillar of the geometry layer.
form manifold-concept
  link structure, like manifold
